astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GbhqONRWT8IQ7kNvwGcIfhj&_nc_oc=Adlp-Z8kGCcSmZ1cgMxzB9f40R5c7FfbPb8m9dQlI5GaQeEGXfYV2eIoUezVRcDVERE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftSbMqMBtS7R4akotnf1DN0bXZwi6LPoR0zp8_-Wm-yVQ&oe=699D83F3"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KOqHupvuCXsQ7kNvwE_n1CK&_nc_oc=AdlEIlP7-GECV--qGY64iVg1EWiOVNYZmUaD8uIZfF1Quxiw-eQH4iH7KFXJ67GG56s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs1WlvlpN9YXOx-F5xBybMZT7-Hh3iVc10_5N_wkrTMtA&oe=699D8496"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ISBZEWs_i48Q7kNvwGBHsGc&_nc_oc=Adkf6cYm3ri0wnKasRUiTH4_R9fPPUy_kqqWZyqlmb7i0e6UJF-0KlY3eUebguuRXfc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs49RN8aSByDqkugYSQbEQbCbnLhLVsJlGvg_w8BbRHjg&oe=699DA33D"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip